{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly forward and save your swarm in THE LAST LADYBUG</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly forward. Choose your path. Save your swarm. You are THE LAST LADYBUG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the skies are ruled by mechanical monsters and the lands are scorched by destruction, only one brave soul remains: THE LAST LADYBUG, the humanoid heroine with wings of steel and a heart of fire. Fly forward and save your swarm in this action packed rail shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/323fa63a61ee3040a734502627653086.poster.avif?t=1761246497\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/323fa63a61ee3040a734502627653086.webm?t=1761246497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/323fa63a61ee3040a734502627653086.mp4?t=1761246497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLY FORWARD</strong> - Fly and blast your way through a colorful 3D world ravaged by a mechanical threat. THE LAST LADYBUG features 15 stunning stages of blistering action and neon chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong> - Branching paths at the end of each stage send you soaring toward different zones. Each route leads to a new challenge and a new chance to rescue your imprisoned bug brethren!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE THE ENEMY</strong> - After fighting your way through waves of enemies, you'll fly into pulse pounding boss fights that'll leave your trigger finger tingling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of bugkind is in your hands. Stretch those wings and dive headfirst into A electrifying pixelated adventure! This is THE LAST LADYBUG!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school  rail shooter!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 stunning stages in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching level selection allowing for multiple play throughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/bedff213f223fe5d475de89c60c022dc.poster.avif?t=1761246497\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/bedff213f223fe5d475de89c60c022dc.webm?t=1761246497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/extras/bedff213f223fe5d475de89c60c022dc.mp4?t=1761246497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974410?t=1761246497","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/28dc21df3e2e256ff3202c8886b0664cebbbc7a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761246497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/b954be7cd5b55be94c485d9795cd95cd6d256640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761246497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974410/b954be7cd5b55be94c485d9795cd95cd6d256640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761246497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}